---
source: crates/wb/tests/cli.rs
expression: wb.transcript
---
$ wb move n3 --below n1
moved n3 below n1
[exit 0]

$ wb relabel n2 Billing
relabeled n2 "Billing"
[exit 0]

$ wb relabel e2 charges
relabeled e2 "charges"
[exit 0]

$ wb delete n2
deleted n2 "Billing" (also removed e1 e2; detached note n4)
[exit 0]

$ wb look
board: b1 "Edits"
turn: 1, agent's turn
counts: 2 nodes, 0 edges, 0 groups, 1 note, 0 annotations
nodes[2]{id,kind,label,by}:
  n1,service,A,agent
  n3,service,C,agent
notes[1]{id,on,text,by}:
  n4,"",why B?,agent
[exit 0]
